wip/py-manimgl: Import py-manimgl-1.7.2.20260909

ManimGL, the 3Blue1Brown animation engine for explanatory math videos,
with the manimgl command (manimgl-3.13).  Master snapshot fafa083
(2026-09-09): the last release, 1.7.2 (2024-12), still renders with
moderngl, while master renders with wgpu (Metal on macOS).

Uses pkgsrc's ffmpeg7 to write videos and TeX Live + dvisvgm for Tex;
depends on the LaTeX packages its default template loads.
